  "details": "<p>This necropolis is notable for the schola-type tomb of Arellia Tertulla, who may have been the wife of\u00a0M.Stlaborius Veius Fronto\u00a0who was <em>duovir quinquennalis</em>\u00a0in A.D. 25-26. Also notable is the monumental tomb of C. Vestorius Priscus who died at age 22 in AD 75-76.\u00a0</p>",
